<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Simmers still in talks, cautions holders.</title>
<headline>Simmers still in talks, cautions holders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simmer and Jack Mines Ltd said on Wednesday talks were still in progress which could impact on its share price if succesfully concluded.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to exercise caution in a brief announcement. No further details were given.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
<p>E-mail: johannesburg.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
